<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>砒毒 on 观颐斋</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E7%A0%92%E6%AF%92/</link><description>Recent content in 砒毒 on 观颐斋</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-cn</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Tue, 07 Jul 2026 15:58:52 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E7%A0%92%E6%AF%92/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>砒毒</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/6-20-pidu/</link><pubDate>Tue, 07 Jul 2026 15:56:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/6-20-pidu/</guid><description>本节为《石室秘录》“砒毒”部分，由&lt;strong&gt;雷公真君&lt;/strong&gt;专论&lt;strong&gt;砒霜中毒&lt;/strong&gt;的急救法则。核心思想是：&lt;strong&gt;砒毒救治当分缓急。初中毒者，急用生甘草、羊血涌吐排毒；毒已入脏、腹痛欲裂者，则须用大黄等泻下排毒，不可拘泥于吐法。救治宜早，迟则肠断不救&lt;/strong&gt;。</description></item></channel></rss>